    entry .intConversion
      info
          - an `Int` converts implicitly to `Q64`, exactly but for `Int.MaxValue` and `Int.MinValue`
          + un `Int` se convertit implicitement en `Q64`, exactement sauf pour `Int.MaxValue` et
          + `Int.MinValue`
      detail
          - The two extremes round by one to `±(2³¹−2)`. There is no conversion from `Long`, as
          - there is none to `F64`, since it would not be exact.
