      + `Long`
  detail
      - An extension on each primitive, as `math.abs`; the signed types `S8`…`S64`, `F32`,
      - `F64`, `Q64`, `Q32` and `Decimal` have an `abs` of their own. `Byte.MinValue.abs` is
      - `Byte.MinValue`, as in Java.
      + Une méthode d'extension sur chaque type primitif, comme `math.abs` ; les types signés
      + `S8`…`S64`, `F32`, `F64`, `Q64`, `Q32` et `Decimal` ont leur propre `abs`.
      + `Byte.MinValue.abs` vaut `Byte.MinValue`, comme en Java.

